config RTC_DRV_TA1618_SC2720
	bool "Nokia TA-1618 SC2720 RTC"
	depends on MACH_NOKIA_TA1618
	depends on RTC_CLASS
	help
	  Read-only real-time clock support for the Nokia 3210 4G TA-1618.
	  The driver exposes the running SC2720 RTC counter through the standard
	  RTC interface without setting time. Alarms, wakeup state and PMIC
	  configuration are unavailable.
